<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 33.75 bln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLO exchange auction totals 33.75 bln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury said its linear government bond (OLO) exchange auction totalled 33.75 billion Belgian francs.</p>
<p>Treasury offered OLOs 27 (4.00 pct, Jan 2000), 6 (9.00 pct, March 2003), 19 (6.50 pct, March 2005) and 26 (6.25 pct, March 2007) against OLOs 15 (6.75 pct, May 1997) and 8 (9.25 pct, Aug 1997).</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
